    "keywords":  [
                     "字段",
                     "会话",
                     "历史",
                     "session",
                     "表",
                     "end_at"
                 ],
    "chunks":  [
                   {
                       "chunk_id":  "K09.a",
                       "section_title":  "元数据四表",
                       "text":  "players以user_id唯一，含registered_at、cohort_version、available_at。player_attributes以attribute_id唯一，user_id关联玩家，含region_id/language/client及[valid_from,valid_to)有效期，valid_to可null，同玩家有效期不重叠。story_calendar以story_id×region_id为键，含version_id、region_open_at、expected_story_minutes、available_at。source_catalog以source_id为键，含region_id、event_kind、available_at；R1的story_start/session来源为src01/src02，R2为src03/src04，R3为src05/src06。",
                       "source_refs":  [
                                           {
                                               "source_id":  "S01",
                                               "sha256":  "35da4960ae6280f6fbc867594880fb667639edfb0c01e90f82c7ec1f867fb451",
                                               "locator":  "/definition/public_context/tables"
                                           },
                                           {
                                               "source_id":  "S01",
                                               "sha256":  "35da4960ae6280f6fbc867594880fb667639edfb0c01e90f82c7ec1f867fb451",
                                               "locator":  "/definition/public_context/source_catalog"
                                           }
                                       ]
                   },
                   {
                       "chunk_id":  "K09.b",
                       "section_title":  "行为两表和证据三表",
                       "text":  "session_uploads以upload_id为上传主键，session_id去重，关联user_id/source_id；start_at\u003cend_at\u003c=available_at，时长由结束减开始。story_start_uploads以upload_id为上传主键、event_id去重，关联user_id/story_id/session_id/source_id，event_time在会话区间内且不晚于available_at。qualification_checks以record_id记录met/not_met，not_met的prereq_met_at=null；collection_checks记录source_id/interval_id和[start_at,end_at)；watermark_checks记录source_id/watermark_at。三证据表均含checked_at、available_at，沿用各自时间、重传和冲突合同；除此及属性valid_to外各字段非空。",
                       "source_refs":  [
                                           {
                                               "source_id":  "S01",
                                               "sha256":  "35da4960ae6280f6fbc867594880fb667639edfb0c01e90f82c7ec1f867fb451",
                                               "locator":  "/definition/public_context/tables"
                                           }
                                       ]
                   },
                   {
                       "chunk_id":  "K09.c",
                       "section_title":  "历史输入按完成与当时水位归属",
                       "text":  "历史会话在有效水位和覆盖条件下，h=min(t0,当时最新可见session水位)，a_W=max(registered_at,历史观测起点,h-W天)，W为7或28。先筛available_at\u003c=t0再按session_id去重，取a_W\u003c=end_at\u003ch且end_at\u003ct0的完成会话。跨左端开始但窗内结束计完整时长；t0前开始、t0后结束的未来完整时长不能进入特征。不能写成end_at\u003c=t0，也不能固定以t0为窗口右端。缺水位、冲突或覆盖不足沿用报错；正常无会话的均值/占比/最近间隔可null，不补造数据。",
                       "source_refs":  [
